                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a85e8f75-80ef-4b02-9269-dd65dcab1422",
                                "sense_id": "72d8006c-86f7-34ff-bdc7-7127919e8367",
                                "text": "I can just remember an old brown-coated man who was the Walton of this stream, who had come over from Newcastle, England, with his son, the latter a stout and hearty man who had lifted an anchor in his day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "979e3415-ab6b-4e1d-a1f9-885eeaf64565",
                                "sense_id": "72d8006c-86f7-34ff-bdc7-7127919e8367",
                                "text": "Was sitting on a molar cusp nibbling a remnant of dry toast, when I looked out and saw a white-coated man with a shiney instrument in his hand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "102128ed-b830-4b38-b988-ffdddb68ebf8",
                                "sense_id": "72d8006c-86f7-34ff-bdc7-7127919e8367",
                                "text": "A few seconds after photograph 17 was taken; note that the coated woman has stopped to chat to the group."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
